# Arms, drawn over the body and head at row 10 of the frame (+ the pose's dy, + the part's oy attribute).
# Keys: D E F sleeve (shirt ramp), A B skin, o outline. @meta hand = where props attach (part coordinates).
# Arms are drawn last, so a hand at the ear or on the head covers the hair and the headset.

# ── s (towards the viewer) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@frame arms-down-s
@meta {"hand":[13,6]}
................
................
..oo........oo..
.oDE........EFo.
.oDE........EFo.
.oAB........ABo.
.oAB........ABo.
..oo........oo..

@frame arms-swing-a-s
@meta {"hand":[13,5]}
................
................
..oo........oo..
.oDE........EFo.
.oDE........EFo.
.oAB........ABo.
.oAB........oo..
.oAB............
..oo............

@frame arms-swing-b-s from=arms-swing-a-s flip=x

@frame arms-type-a-s
@meta {"hand":[10,5]}
................
................
..oo........oo..
.oDE........EFo.
.oDEo......oEFo.
..oBAAo..oAABo..
...ooo....ooo...

@frame arms-type-b-s
@meta {"hand":[10,5]}
................
................
